{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜加快公屋流轉(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-16-14-10-002MCOO32Z.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：加快公屋流轉</p><p>公屋輪候時間預料會降至4.5年，還有何措施可以加快流轉？房委會就通過提高「家有初生家庭」按揭成數等措施，成效有幾大？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>房委會資助房屋小組委員會委員梁文廣</p><p>團結香港基金助理研究總監梁躍昊</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.112192+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:31.419575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:47.719673+00:00","content_hash":"fbf170aadd2d27552ad06270783cecc629e8f0e1d37868d4f65bbe058ba34081","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.112192+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}